{"3582160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Primeval", "steam_appid": 3582160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Primeval</strong> is a brutal third-person survival horror game. Search for clues in a school where terrifying monsters lurk around every corner, and fight for your only chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plot Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horrific experimental monsters have somehow completely overrun the campus. Someone was aware of the situation and attempted some remedial measures, but the results appear far from ideal. Runchan, who has just groggily woken up, has clearly missed the best window to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras/cd5737cfe2f3aa3bb220dc21f71d0fb8.avif?t=1788147775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras_big/cd5737cfe2f3aa3bb220dc21f71d0fb8.webp?t=1788147775 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High School - A</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A private high school founded by Chairman Röntgen, now completely under lockdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras/2d72d116a7f4844f93ab5cf63c31abcc.avif?t=1788147775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras_big/2d72d116a7f4844f93ab5cf63c31abcc.webp?t=1788147775 width=1560 height=834 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Introduction</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runchan</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A track and field athlete, a transfer student scouted by the school's administration for her outstanding performance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    On her very first day after transferring, she took part in club activities, yet for some unknown reason, she fell unconscious in the infirmary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras/2decd1e88e2489e49154b3c80b07cca8.avif?t=1788147775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras_big/2decd1e88e2489e49154b3c80b07cca8.avif?t=1788147775 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat, exploration, puzzle-solving, and resource management — and many more elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras/3db81d6c4d5bf7aee92ec2718178c37f.avif?t=1788147775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras_big/3db81d6c4d5bf7aee92ec2718178c37f.webp?t=1788147775 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Primeval</strong> is a brutal third-person survival horror game. Search for clues in a school where terrifying monsters lurk around every corner, and fight for your only chance of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plot Synopsis</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horrific experimental monsters have somehow completely overrun the campus. Someone was aware of the situation and attempted some remedial measures, but the results appear far from ideal. Runchan, who has just groggily woken up, has clearly missed the best window to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras/cd5737cfe2f3aa3bb220dc21f71d0fb8.avif?t=1788147775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras_big/cd5737cfe2f3aa3bb220dc21f71d0fb8.webp?t=1788147775 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>High School - A</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A private high school founded by Chairman Röntgen, now completely under lockdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras/2d72d116a7f4844f93ab5cf63c31abcc.avif?t=1788147775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras_big/2d72d116a7f4844f93ab5cf63c31abcc.webp?t=1788147775 width=1560 height=834 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Character Introduction</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runchan</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A track and field athlete, a transfer student scouted by the school's administration for her outstanding performance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    On her very first day after transferring, she took part in club activities, yet for some unknown reason, she fell unconscious in the infirmary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras/2decd1e88e2489e49154b3c80b07cca8.avif?t=1788147775\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3582160/extras_big/2decd1e88e2489e49154b3c80b07cca8.avif?t=1788147775 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat, exploration, puzzle-solving, and resource management — and many more elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb